{
  "_comment": [
    "Every paired comparison the thesis reports, read by src/paired_stats.py (FLAGS.md NS-01, NS-07).",
    "A condition is a run directory, optionally narrowed by `select` (record field -> value); records of",
    "several configs in one condition are pooled per question. A contrast is a weighted sum of conditions,",
    "evaluated per question and then bootstrapped over questions.",
    "`expected` holds the figure as published in Thesis/notes/11-evaluation-readiness.md, for --check.",
    "`run_map` (prefix -> prefix) points --check at the run the notes used when the thesis reference has",
    "since been rescored (the #25 re-gold of 2026-09-22, notes 11 section 43.2).",
    "`evaluated_population` and `ci_method` record where the notes computed a figure differently from the",
    "thesis convention (135 discriminating questions; percentile bootstrap, random.Random(0), 10,000)."
